abstract: "Minimal embodied agent (13->64->6 predictor + Phi 22->64->1 self-model + 13->7 active attention) in continuous 20x20 physics with fog zone (x>14, noise 0.15/0.60). Grid battery (13->128->128->6, +-5 teleport, N=30): detection z=20.6 CI[16.0,25.5], habituation 86% d=3.5, weight persistence post/pre 0.02 (restore pre-W 67.5, freeze 137.2). Stimulus generalization C3 (1.1 vs 0.9) shows habituation of displacement magnitude, not vector: learning without distinguishing. Phi 15->64->1 scalar MSE to |epsilon|: r=0.701, r_cross=0.730, offline presence ratio 0.13; isolated causal d=-1.61, attention gate flagged as confound in the integrated run. Continuous long run 30k steps, 0% fog with food outside fog. EWC lambda=5 + ortho 0.01 non-load-bearing for same-task interference. Runs on a MacBook Pro (M4 Pro, Apple silicon) with MPS, no discrete GPU."
